---
title: Sequence — Installment + Income Verification
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  rect rgb(232, 240, 254)
    note over C,SBT: (a) Installment payment loop — CEI pattern
    participant C as Client
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant SC as LoanController
    participant SBT as CreditPassport
    C->>FE: Pay installment
    FE->>SC: processInstallment CEI
    SC->>SBT: update on final payment
    SC-->>C: receipt + balance
  end

  rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    note over C,KYC: (b) Income verification
    participant API as Express API
    participant KYC as KYC Provider
    C->>API: Open-banking consent
    API->>KYC: verify income documents
    KYC-->>API: VC attestation
    API-->>C: borrowing limit updated
  end
